<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan details forex reserves at end-May.</title>
<headline>Pakistan details forex reserves at end-May.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the</p>
<p>weekly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in</p>
<p>Pakistan:</p>
<p> (BLN DLRS)		 May 31     May 24    May 30, 1996</p>
